a constatada a presen\134u00e7a de incrusta\134u00e7\134u00f5es e de outras altera\134u00e7\134u00f5es que possam comprometer a qualidade higi\134u00eanico\055sanit\134u00e1ria da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural devem ser revistas as opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o e adotadas as medidas corretivas necess\134u00e1rias\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 4\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 4\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p6c4\1374\0563\0564\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p6c4\1374\0563\0564\042\054 \042template\042\072 \042Frases\1374\1373\1374\137S\042\054 \042editorPrefix\042\072 \042F\1374\1373\1374\137S\137\042\175\054 \042q\137p6c1\1374\0563\0565\042\072 \173\042rects\042\072 \133\133175\05625\054 184\05625\054 213\056875\054 193\0560\135\054 \133214\056875\054 184\05625\054 253\0565\054 193\0560\135\135\054 \042page\042\072 5\054 \042col\042\072 1\054 \042code\042\072 \0424\0563\0565\042\054 \042proc\042\072 \0424\0563\042\054 \042allowNA\042\072 false\054 \042classField\042\072 \042classe\137p6\1374\0563\0565\042\054 \042frases\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042A higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o do reservat\134u00f3rio deve ser realizada de forma que garanta a manuten\134u00e7\134u00e3o das condi\134u00e7\134u00f5es higi\134u00eanico\055sanit\134u00e1rias satisfat\134u00f3rias e minimize o risco de contamina\134u00e7\134u00e3o da \134u00e1gua mineral natural e da \134u00e1gua natural\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042A higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o do reservat\134u00f3rio deve ser realizada por funcion\134u00e1rios comprovadamente capacitados e deve ser registrada\056\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\054 \042P\042\072 3\175\135\054 \042P\042\072 3\054 \042statusField\042\072 \042estado\137q\137p6c1\1374\0563\0565\042\054 \042resultField\042\072 \042peso\137q\137p6c1\1374\0563\0565\042\054 \042template